y runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids, January to February and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 40 years, the most of any pair. In 2025, November to December came in at 30% of normal on the middle, and so far in 2026 February to March sits at 24%. Every one of the 6 grids had its driest year in 2012, with grid 25613 at 44%.</p>"}
